  "bodyHash": "OC6SsH31Mjs=",
  "content": "<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>\n厭倦了過於像素化、數量有限且沒有合適選擇介面的畫作嗎？\n沉浸式繪畫讓使用者能夠透過拖放、螢幕截圖或提供網址的方式，創建屬於自己的 Minecraft 風格畫作。\n無需資源包，支援多人遊戲且易於使用。\n</p><p>本模組提供一個簡單而強大的介面，讓您選擇自己的畫作、其他玩家的作品，或是透過可選資料包提供的畫作。預設資料包可供快速入門！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><p>創作選單讓您能快速將圖片像素化，並套用後製效果與抖色處理，使其看起來更融入 Minecraft 風格，無需繁瑣調整。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><p>但沒有精美畫框的畫作怎麼稱得上完美呢？從多種風格和材質中選擇，讓您的藝術作品更加突出。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><p>透過智慧細節層級、快取和資料的懶載入，效能影響幾乎無法察覺。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><p>還提供發光顏料功能！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><p>您的圖片有透明背景？沒問題，使用塗鴉功能，噴灑在每一面牆上！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><p>這是合成配方。</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_paintings:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=48&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方圖片\"></p><p>\n與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Joy of Painting</a> 相容！\n只需將畫布貼在畫作上即可展示！\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\"></p><h1>給伺服器管理員</h1><p>\n沉浸式繪畫需要傳輸和儲存圖片，在伺服器上可能會累積大量資料。如果您的伺服器頻寬或儲存空間有限，請查看\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\" rel=\"nofollow\">設定檔</a>。\n它允許對使用者進行一些限制，並可調整頻寬節流以符合您的需求。\n</p><h1>資料包</h1><p>\n可選地，使用\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a>\n分享畫作包。\n</p><h1>翻譯</h1><p>\n您希望模組支援您的語言嗎？請協助在\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>\n上翻譯本模組。\n</p><h1>沉浸式系列</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式盔甲&amp;description=眾多獨特且忠於原版風格的盔甲套裝。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式盔甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式飛行器&amp;description=一系列復古風格的飛行器，用於旅行、運輸和探索！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飛行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式旋律&amp;description=在各種樂器上演奏自訂旋律，並煩擾您的朋友！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式繪畫&amp;description=拖放、像素化並懸掛美麗的藝術作品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式繪畫\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式優化&amp;description=輕量級實體計時器，可將您的 TPS 提升一倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式優化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=選擇性邊界&amp;description=在不相關時隱藏醜陋的方塊選擇框線。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"選擇性邊界\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=多面飛行員&amp;description=為沉浸式飛行器新增一系列額外飛行器，並考慮支援 Create 模組。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"多面飛行員\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式機械&amp;description=一系列復古風格的機械，用於運輸、採礦和自動化。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式機械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式家具&amp;description=在遊戲中創建自訂且精美的家具，或從龐大的線上庫中選擇。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a></p><h1>附加元件</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful 附加元件&amp;description=適用於 Faithful 的 32px 材質包附加元件。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Faithful 附加元件\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farids-immersive-resprites\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids 沉浸式重製材質&amp;description=適用於沉浸式旋律和沉浸式繪畫模組的重製材質！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Arids 沉浸式重製材質\">\n</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=6686e86ace76d31262ccd37a5e7f80ba\" alt=\"頁面雜湊值，方便頁面部署。\"></p>",
